### Share-alike compatibility

The OpenNGC data is licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0, which requires attribution and that
adaptations of the data be shared under the same or a compatible license. This
repository does not yet declare its own license. The CC-BY-SA-4.0 obligation
therefore applies only to the bundled data and to adaptations of it, not to the
project's source code, which is a separate work that merely reads the data.

If a license is later chosen for this repository's own code, it must remain
compatible with redistributing the bundled CC-BY-SA-4.0 data — the data files and
their attribution and license stay under CC-BY-SA-4.0 regardless of the code's
license. This share-alike compatibility is a merge-time check for any change that
alters how the catalog is bundled.
